  "legacy_epatch_method": "For files beginning with ASCII Realtech, bytes 8..11 are the little-endian 32-bit firmware version. Linux copies that version into the downloaded patch; its low 16 bits become the reported SubVersNr.",
  "rtbtcore_method": "For files beginning with ASCII RTBTCore, bytes 8..15 describe the container, not SubVersNr. Records use controller versions named by official linux-firmware commits and verified as little-endian bytes inside the corresponding binary.",
  "scope_note": "Patch values attributable to one chip family identify that family. Cross-chip collisions are retained as explicitly ambiguous fingerprints whose full chip lists must be reported. RTBTCore releases without a stated and byte-verified controller version are omitted.",
